ort, the risks are real, but so are the rewards. The key is not to avoid risk, but to manage it〞by staying informed, monitoring the energy transition, and being ready to act when the market shifts. CNOOC isn＊t a sure thing, but it＊s not a dead end either. The decision to sell may be safe, but it＊s not necessarily smart.
